# Raw captures never enter the repository.
#
# One boot at 100 kS/s for sixteen seconds is 1.6 million rows and about
# 37 MB. Six runs per variant and five variants is over a gigabyte, and
# docs/DESIGN.md's data flow puts all of it under results/<variant>/,
# which is one "git add ." away from being committed forever.
#
# What is kept is what was derived from them: summary.md, which carries
# the means, the spreads and every discarded run with its reason, and the
# plots. Those are a few kilobytes and they are the evidence the
# write-up cites.
#
# Where the captures actually live is written in docs/BRINGUP.md, beside
# the command that produces them.
results/*/*.csv
